  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 及 Neo 提供大量活躍模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Name Tag Tweaks 針對遊戲中的「命名牌」物品進行了若干調整。擁有自訂名稱的實體死亡時，會掉落其對應的命名牌。本模組新增了一項指令，可無需使用鐵砧即可修改命名牌內容。此外，模組也提供了一個專屬的合成配方。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需安裝 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s Extra Bundle\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"運行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>droppedNameTagbyEntityKeepsNameValue</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，實體死亡時掉落的命名牌將保留其原名。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNameTagCommand</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，新增 /nametag &lt;name&gt; 指令。用於無需鐵砧即可更改命名牌內容。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameTagCommandReplaceUnderscoresWithSpaces</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，使用 /nametag 指令時，會自動將底線替換為空白。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>合成配方：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"504\" height=\"288\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>/nametag &lt;name&gt; 指令：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"439\" height=\"118\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><strong>執行結果：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"979\" height=\"220\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>以下展示命名過的豬在死亡時掉落命名牌：</strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/name-tag-tweaks/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"520\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多詳細資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於評論數量眾多且分散在各個模組頁面，難以追蹤，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他需求，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。感謝支持！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
